| 13 | WAVE TWO | `L17-2d` road items as slot children with fields (`L41b`). BUILT (PR #268, 2026-11-18): the founding road's ranks and rulings stand as 351 child carriers under `docs/road/`, tagged `road/rank` or `road/ruling` with a four-digit `order` (a ruling also names its `group`), gathered by filter, `tools/road-split.mjs` reading the structure; the gathered road renders whole as `road.html` (PR #280, over the rendered tiddler of PR #278), and the meta emitter quotes a leading-zero order so it reads back (PR #293) | A backlog that reprioritizes by filter dogfoods the caps on the house's own road; a content lane on this carrier alone. |

